# Check out every text file with LF on every OS: the POSIX launchers (scripts/launch, scripts/guard,
# scripts/hook-open, bin/sm) fail under sh with CRLF, and the suites read shipped files expecting LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
# The Windows twins are batch files and keep CRLF, the line ending cmd.exe is written for.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
